  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 509.02 Maps of Mooring Field, Mooring Subfields, and Nearshore Areas. The division shall maintain maps at the division office of mooring fields, mooring subfields, and nearshore areas.\n\nSource. #7940, eff 8-23-03; ss by #8775, eff 12-16-06; ss by #9975, eff 8-20-11 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Pda 500); ss by #12958, eff 12-24-19",
